{"4429290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Incentive Program", "steam_appid": 4429290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/f9309999a5a68f143736b9af58710a30.poster.avif?t=1787569892\" width=1170 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/f9309999a5a68f143736b9af58710a30.webm?t=1787569892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/f9309999a5a68f143736b9af58710a30.mp4?t=1787569892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>// INCOMING MESSAGE...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <i><strong>OrphiTech</strong></i> family! Your role as an Incentive Program operator is simple: play the game, upgrade your workstation, hit your quotas, <span class=\"bb_strike\">don't ask questions</span>, <strong>and get paid. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/cea020706665ee1cf710b3fd3e3752b1.poster.avif?t=1787569892\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/cea020706665ee1cf710b3fd3e3752b1.webm?t=1787569892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/cea020706665ee1cf710b3fd3e3752b1.mp4?t=1787569892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; OPERATE THE TERMINAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your <strong>mysterious work</strong> at the personal terminal - play exciting match-3 puzzles and explode into satisfying combos, to meet increasingly important work quotas. Every move counts. A carefully planned move can erupt into chain reactions worth hundreds of times their original value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/dae9e2b9b3d789e73d6f1233be5b2b6e.poster.avif?t=1787569892\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/dae9e2b9b3d789e73d6f1233be5b2b6e.webm?t=1787569892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/dae9e2b9b3d789e73d6f1233be5b2b6e.mp4?t=1787569892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; EXPLOIT THE SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hard-earned cash at our <strong>oddly convenient office vending machine</strong> to assemble powerful builds with rule‑breaking trinkets, chance-bending floppy disks, and emergency snacks. Discover synergies, break the rules, and turn single matches into impossible combo chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/5e001c5300b8dc068890ca11d9ec9ee3.poster.avif?t=1787569892\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/5e001c5300b8dc068890ca11d9ec9ee3.webm?t=1787569892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/5e001c5300b8dc068890ca11d9ec9ee3.mp4?t=1787569892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; UNRAVEL THE MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each ████, you will learn more about the wonderful ongoings at OrphiTech. If you see anything strange, don't panic! Anomalies will be quickly handled by our Janitorial Services Department, to keep you safe and productive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/00a5b16dfe07d0e9d183c3ba0ca69255.poster.avif?t=1787569892\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/00a5b16dfe07d0e9d183c3ba0ca69255.webm?t=1787569892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4429290/extras/00a5b16dfe07d0e9d183c3ba0ca69255.mp4?t=1787569892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt; FULL GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hundreds of Item Combinations</strong> to discover and exploit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ Trinkets</strong> that bend the rules of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Floppy Disks </strong>that manipulate the odds </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ Consumables </strong>that create immediate effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Overclocks</strong> that radically alter how the program behaves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ Boss Levels </strong>that can break careless builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ Starting Builds</strong> with distinct modifiers and difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables and Upgrades </strong>to supercharge your next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Areas</strong> of the Office Facility to explore...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>END OF MESSAGE //</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAQs</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Is this game about luck or strategy?</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Randomness creates new opportunities every run, but success mainly depends on skill, planning, build construction, and making the most of what you're given. You also unlock new and powerful tools as you progress.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>How long is a single run?</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A typical run lasts 10-30 minutes, depending on your  success...</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>How long is a full playthrough to &quot;complete&quot; the game?</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the full game we expect a first &quot;real ending&quot; completion to take ~10 hours. There will also be multiple starting loadouts and game modes to explore beyond that.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Are runs saveable or resumable mid-session?</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will there be controller support?</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game will have full controller and Steamdeck support.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Is there any AI used in the making of this game?</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No. The game is lovingly crafted by real humans.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s